@186. Thus does wisdom decrease down to ignorance, as light decreases to shade.

@253[2]. In each Society the light decreases from the middle to the boundaries.

@302. The atmospheres... decrease in downward progression according to degrees of breadth... @303.

Decree.; Decernere. Decretum.

