@AE 122[4]. To "deny himself" (Matthew 16:24; Mark 8:34) = to reject the evils which are from proprium.

@864[5]. To "deny himself" = not to be led by himself, but by the Lord; and he denies himself who shuns and is averse to evils because they are sins...

Deny.; Negare.
