@400[3]. When such have longed to know what heavenly joy is... @409[end].

@427. All in that World meet, and converse together, when they long to do so...

@450[2]. The Angels... long for nothing more than to perform offices, to instruct, and to convey into Heaven.

@479. There is constantly... the affection of the longing to return to his like, thus to his reigning love.

