@--[end]. As this capacity and longing for conjunction into one is in every single thing...

@180. The states of this love are... a mutual longing of the disposition and the heart to do everything good to the other. General article.

@--[end]. This mutual longing... is of the body from these things.

@228. Especially by accommodations to desires...

@229. For those who long for love truly conjugial, the Lord provides similitudes...

