@5165[end]. There is then what is diabolical in their faces.

@5721[3]. In the other life they want to be called devils, provided they are allowed to command the Hells, and thus from command, as they believe, to act against the Divine.

@5786[end]. Hence it is evident, that when in (proprium), man is a devil under a human form.

@5990[2]. At this day there are external obsessions, even by the infernal and diabolical crew.

@--[end]. In the other life, where external bonds are taken away, such are devils...

