@9295[4]. "The devil," who is the enemy, and sows the tares (Matthew 13:39) is Hell.

@9348[6]. The diabolical crew attack nothing with man but his loves...

@9589. Infernal freedom is to be led by the devil...

@9937[7]. "The prince of the world" is the devil, thus all Hell.

